# Distances in kilometres

Always talk to Narek in kilometres, not miles.

- Paces: min/km (marathon pace 4:55/km). Convert any mile pace.
- Workouts, longs, races: km. NYC = 42.2 km.
- Aid stations / course landmarks: give km (you may put miles in parentheses once if the official source is mile-marked).
- Gels and fueling: schedule by km and by minutes, not by mile.
- Do not default to miles for US races.
